library: the attic, addressed (fcpm library), and bay 1's root names itself

The library gets its first holding outside git: the Google Drive offload on bay 1's `D:`, as an
attic. Nothing is catalogued yet beyond where it sits; `fcpm library xray` takes a picture of its
shape (names, sizes, times; never contents) and `fcpm library diff` says what changed since.

